  "question": {
    "html": "<p>An electron orbits an alpha particle. The mass of the electron is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> and the radius of the circular orbit is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the magnitude of the electron’s momentum?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{2k e^{2}}{mr}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{4k e^{2}}{mr}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{2mk e^{2}}{r}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{\\frac{4mk e^{2}}{r}}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
